向的投影长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"OM_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"OP_{0}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/434cc78c0c8ac17ba55cff40324fc2fc75c9e235a4e1d51e25156b4d834fccc5.png","width":429,"height":129,"width_mm":50.447,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\nD. 测量 "},{"type":"math","value":"OP"},{"type":"text","value":" 及 "},{"type":"math","value":"OM"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"ON"},{"type":"text","value":" 的长度\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/de1d2075386756ae033456d4bff10b7cde118feba632dc923c059374554bbe12.png","width":441,"height":129,"width_mm":51.858,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n14-Ⅱ. (7分)某实验小组要测量一未知电源的电动势和内阻。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7fada3a358202de04e640af8f116f0dc8d87e854518e1db954f09b079c345dc9.png","width":549,"height":279,"width_mm":64.558,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q14-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cdfe8ee0c8de173435436c03cc599abf1ce35d6981901fb9b6744387dff9ca75.png","width":288,"height":270,"width_mm":33.867,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q14-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n(1)小明用多用电表对电源的电动势进行粗测,将多用电表的选择开关旋至直流“10V”挡,将多用电表的红表笔与电源的（填空）(选填“正极”或“负极”)连接,进行正确操作后,多用电表的指针如图甲所示,则该电源电动势的测量值为（填空）V。\n(2)为了准确测量该电源的电动势和内阻,小亮从以下器材中选取合适器材,连接好电路后,记录了多组电阻箱的电阻 R 和对应的电流表的示数 I。\nA. 电流表 G(量程为 0～1mA, 内阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{g}=100\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" );\nB. 电阻箱 "},{"type":"math","value":"R(0\\sim999.9\\Omega)"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\nC. 定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=2900\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\nD. 定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}=1400\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\nE. 开关 S 一个, 导线若干。\n(3)他们将电流表改装成量程为0～3V的电压表,定值电阻应选用（填空）(选填“ "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ”或“ "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ”);请在答题卷中将电路补充完整（填空）。\n(4)以 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为横轴,以 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为纵轴,将实验测得的数据描点、连线后得到了一条倾斜直线,该直线的纵轴截距为b,斜率为k,则该电源电动势和内阻分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空），"},{"type":"math","value":"r="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）。(用题中所给物理量的符号表示,其中改装电压表的电阻用 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{v}"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示,不考虑电压表的分流)"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-Ⅰ（7分）(1)B （1分） (2)AD （2分） (3)偶然误差 （2分）（4）B （2分）\n14-Ⅱ（7分）（1）正极（1分） 2.9V（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/501c286a33015c0e11b6975f7352aa8c1d7802fac6236e3c73ebd3b318e95e2a.png","width":208,"height":190,"width_mm":26.3},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（4）"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{R_{v}}{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{k}{b}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"99b477506f9f53f385b0abe94d23f387955a9bfbac7dcc25809d8276a5e8251d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. (8 分)一款气垫运动鞋如图甲所示, 鞋底塑料空间内充满气体(可视为理想气体), 运动时通过压缩气体来提供一定的缓冲。单只鞋子的鞋底塑料空间等效为如图乙所示的模型, 轻质活塞 A 可无摩擦上下移动, 气体被压缩时可等效为活塞 A 下移, 活塞 A 的等效作用面积恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=200cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。鞋子未被穿上时, 当环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":" , 每只鞋气垫内气体体积 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0}=36cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" 。忽略鞋底其他结构产生的弹力, 且气垫不漏气, 大气压强也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(1)若未穿时,气温缓缓上升,气垫内气体体积增大。\n①气体分子平均速率 （填空） (选填“增大”、“不变”、“减小”), 单位时间撞击单位面积的分子数 （填空） (选填“增大”、“不变”、“减小”);\n②若气体体积增大到 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}=40cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此过程中气体吸收的热量为 Q=0.6J，求气体内能的变化量。\n(2)若质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=50kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 的学生穿上该运动鞋,双脚竖直站立在水平面上,求单只鞋子气垫内气体的体积。(气垫内气体与环境温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 始终相等)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bc59a88c81c17de03a68cd7d31b9ed0e36bb5916e6b4cac15f03335303c5bb4f.png","width":253,"height":153,"width_mm":29.61,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/813e053ddb8b46b3264570f65cb996e7b240b7ce99e7c06f712dd753ad577a99.png","width":237,"height":261,"width_mm":27.869,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数: 重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）(1) ①增大（1分） 减小（1分） ②增加0.2J（3分） (2)"},{"type":"math","value":"32\\mathrm{cm}^3"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）\n（1）②外界对气体做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=-p_{0}\\Delta V=-10^{5}\\times(40-36)\\times10^{-6}J=-0.4J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据热力学第一定律可知气体内能增加"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q = 0.2J"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n（2）人穿上后气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1} = p_{0} + \\frac{mg}{2S} = (10^{5} + \\frac{50\\times10}{2 \\times 200 \\times 10^{-4}}) \\mathrm{Pa} = 1.125 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n根据玻意耳定律"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}V_{0}=p_{1}V_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}=32cm^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3305379ffd14d9940edb4418c55bd860296786a4b5f608ee95cd87ac9d37d2b3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. (11分)一游戏装置的竖直截面如图所示,足够长的倾斜轨道AB、半径为R=0.08m的竖直圆轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CDC'"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"CC'"},{"type":"text","value":" 稍错开）、水平轨道BC和 "},{"type":"math","value":"C'E"},{"type":"text","value":" 连接成一个抛体装置。高台右侧有一水平地面FG,与高台的高度差为H=0.8m,F右侧d=0.6m的Q处有一圆环S,圆环平面面向高台,圆环圆心与轨道在同一竖直面内,圆心离地 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{s}=0.35m"},{"type":"text","value":" ,半径r=0.05m。现将一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块1从AB上距BC高度h处静止释放,运动到C点时,与静止在C点、质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑块2发生弹性碰撞,碰后滑块2进入圆轨道绕行一周后从E点水平飞出。只要滑块2从圆环S穿出,游戏就成功。已知,轨道BC与滑块1的动摩擦因数从B点开始均匀减小,B点处 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{B}=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点处 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{C}=0"},{"type":"text","value":" ,其余各段均光滑, "},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{BC}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。滑块1、2均可视为质点, "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=m_{2}=1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ,不计空气阻力,不计各衔接处的机械能损失。\n(1)若滑块 2 恰能通过 D 点,求滑块 2 在圆心等高处 P 点时的加速度大小和对轨道的压力大小;\n(2)要使游戏成功,求满足条件的释放高度 h;\n(3)某次游戏时,滑块2在圆轨道某处脱轨,飞出后恰能过圆心O,求滑块1的释放高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h'"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c94a0fb2f480be661ff5d6e6649277b1d9532321e6805c0ad1efabc1e07656ef.png","width":922,"height":339,"width_mm":108.36,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数: 重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"10\\sqrt{10}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"30N（4分）（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"0.25m\\leq h\\leq0.275m"},{"type":"text","value":"（4分）（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"h'=\\frac{13+4\\sqrt{3}}{100}m"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg = \\frac{mv_{D}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D} = \\sqrt{gR} = \\sqrt{0.8}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n从 P 点到 D 点动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{P}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{P}=\\sqrt{3gR}=\\sqrt{2.4}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{Pn}=3g\\quad a_{P\\tau}=g"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{P}=\\sqrt{a_{Pn}^{2}+a_{P\\tau}^{2}}=\\sqrt{10}g=10\\sqrt{10}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n在 P 点："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{P} = ma_{pn} = 3mg = 30N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n由牛顿第三定律得，在 P 点压力为 30N\n（2）①物块恰好过最高点，"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{1}-\\frac{\\mu_{B}}{2}mg\\overline{BC}-2mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}=0.25m"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）\n检验得，该处释放物块刚好过圆环 S 的圆心"},{"type":"text","value":"②物块过圆环 S 的最高点，"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\sqrt{\\frac{2(H-h_{s}-r)}{g}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2(0.8-0.35-0.05)}{10}}=\\sqrt{0.08}s"},{"type":"text","value":"E 点速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}'=\\frac{d}{t}=\\frac{0.6}{\\sqrt{0.08}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n从释放点到 E 点，"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{2}-\\frac{\\mu_{B}}{2}mg\\overline{BC}=\\frac{1}{2}m(v_{E}')^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=0.275m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n所以释放高度"},{"type":"math","value":"0.25m\\leq h\\leq0.275m"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ac9a319315de735680560f106f02c45b44cac896c932f05f0c5e1971976d2c97.png","width":302,"height":296,"width_mm":38.2},{"type":"text","value":"（3）在脱离点："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta=\\frac{mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"从脱离点到圆心位置沿着速度方向："},{"type":"math","value":"vt-\\frac{1}{2}g\\cos\\theta t^{2}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{2v}{g\\cos\\theta}"},{"type":"text","value":"垂直速度方向："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}g\\sin\\theta t^{2}=R"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}gR}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n从释放点到抛出点，由动能定理得："},{"type":"math","value":"mgh'-\\frac{\\mu_{B}}{2}mg\\overline{BC}-mg(R+R\\sin\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"h'=\\frac{13+4\\sqrt{3}}{100}m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"57eb985f385ef97eb79986ad2b7a80f0db32e04d1eac512637f5ff9979d863a9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (12 分)如图所示,固定在水平面上的光滑金属导轨 PQO 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}Q_{1}O"},{"type":"text","value":" 在 O 点相接,在 O 点处连有一尺寸足够小的电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=1\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" (电阻尺寸忽略不计,图中未画出),金属导轨在虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":" 处通过绝缘材料断开,导轨通过单刀双掷开关 S 与智能电源、电感形成电路。智能电源始终提供 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}=1A"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电流,电感的自感系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=1H"},{"type":"text","value":" 。导轨 PQ 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"P_{1}Q_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 平行,间距 l=2m, △"},{"type":"math","value":"QOQ_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为等腰三角形,顶角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\angle QOQ_{1}=74^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"aa'"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":" 间距 d=1m,且均与导轨 PQ 垂直,虚线与导轨围成的矩形区域 I 和 △"},{"type":"math","value":"QOQ_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域 II 内有竖直向下的匀强磁场,磁感应强度大小均为 B=1T。甲、乙为导体棒,甲静止在区域 I 左边界虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"aa'"},{"type":"text","value":" 处,乙静止在虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":" 右侧附近。已知甲的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{\\text{甲}}=1kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ,乙的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{\\text{乙}}=2kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ,导轨和金属棒所有电阻忽略不计。初始时开关 S 接 1,当甲滑过 "},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":" 时立即将开关改接 2,甲乙发生弹性碰撞。此后甲棒再次离开磁场时将其取走,甲、乙始终与导轨接触良好且平行于虚线 "},{"type":"math","value":"aa'"},{"type":"text","value":" 。(当 F=-kx 时, "},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ),求\n(1)开关接 1 的持续时间,以及甲到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":" 处时的速度;\n(2)从甲棒开始运动到最后离开磁场,甲棒在磁场中运动的时间;\n(3)分析判断乙棒向右能否滑过 O 点,若能求出经过 O 点时的速度,若不能请说明理由。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f9272e6e3ff574b9e286370088042b8396f693fe1291667b5b42c639069f4e93.png","width":767,"height":387,"width_mm":90.09,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q17-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）(1)1s，"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\,m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"(1+\\frac{\\pi}{2})s"},{"type":"text","value":"（6分）(3)能，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4}{9}\\,m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（3分）\n（1）由题知棒甲做匀加速直线运动，由牛顿第二定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{BI_{0}l}{m}=2\\,m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由运动学公式有"},{"type":"math","value":"d=\\frac{1}{2}at^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得t=1s（1分）\n棒甲到达"},{"type":"math","value":"bb'"},{"type":"text","value":"处的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=at=2\\,m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）碰后"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{甲}}'=\\frac{m_{\\text{甲}}-m_{\\text{乙}}}{m_{\\text{甲}}+m_{\\text{乙}}}v_{0}=\\frac{1-2}{1+2}\\times2=-\\frac{2}{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{乙}}'=\\frac{2m_{\\text{甲}}}{m_{\\text{甲}}+m_{\\text{乙}}}v_{0}=\\frac{2\\times1}{1+2}\\times2=\\frac{4}{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n电感电动势与甲棒电动势相等"},{"type":"math","value":"Blv=L\\frac{\\Delta I}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），整理化简得"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{Blx}{L}"},{"type":"text","value":"棒甲在磁场中的安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F=-\\frac{B^{2}l^{2}}{L}x=-4x,\\quad x"},{"type":"text","value":"为向左的位移，所以导体棒甲做简谐振动。\n周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m_{\\text{甲}}}{k}}=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{4}}=\\pi s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n假设甲向左运动不能穿出磁场，则"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{0+4x}{2}x=0-\\frac{1}{2}m(v_{\\text{甲}}')^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{1}{3}m<1m"},{"type":"text","value":"，假设成立（1分）\n所以甲棒在磁场中运动的总时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\text{总}}=t+\\frac{1}{2}T=(1+\\frac{\\pi}{2})s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）乙在右侧磁场中运动时，设切割长度为"},{"type":"math","value":"l_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"，对乙应用动量定理，在极短时间内，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B^{2}l_{x}^{2}v_{x}}{R}\\cdot\\Delta t=m\\cdot\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n令"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x=v_{x}\\cdot\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"则对全过程有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum\\frac{B^{2}l_{x}^{2}\\Delta x}{R}=\\frac{B^{2}}{R}\\sum\\Delta V=\\frac{B^{2}}{R}\\cdot V_{\\text{四棱锥}}=m_{\\text{乙}}(v'_{\\text{乙}}-v''_{\\text{乙}})"},{"type":"text","value":"其中，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{乙}}^{''}"},{"type":"text","value":"是乙到达O点时的速度，"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{\\text{四棱锥}}=\\frac{1}{3}l^{2}h=\\frac{1}{3}l^{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}l}{\\tan\\frac{\\angle QOQ_{1}}{2}}=\\frac{16}{9}m^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{乙}}^{''}=\\frac{4}{9}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bf0981b72f4766e0dcd378e74745324d1f14bdaebd43549e5de57a150739fab2.png","width":151,"height":263,"width_mm":19.1},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fd7741e31526a4bfd4d4ea6b68fef1ac84ba0af69ab9ebcf05fd6e7517a70c59.png","width":180,"height":265,"width_mm":22.7},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f2a7f7445840af7f3bfca166d009bdf83f52ab1481a75a3b5b10ad9e99ecf8c1.png","width":242,"height":284,"width_mm":30.7}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinhua-shixiao-2511","source_question_id":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"91c6ccd8c444fff8b7e95e6ccefd9b996e54d548a3530d6ddd2db51e9dcf58f1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分)2025 年 10 月,我国自主研发的聚变能实验装置“夸父启明”(BEST)完成底座安装。其内部重要组成部分——托卡马克的简化模拟磁场如图乙所示,半径为 R 的足够长水平圆柱形区域内,分布着水平向右的匀强磁场 I ,磁感应强度大小为 B ,磁场 I 所在区域外侧分布有厚度为 R 的环形磁场 II ,其磁感应强度大小也为 B ,且大小处处相同,方向与磁场 I 中磁场方向垂直,其横截面图与纵截面图分别如图丁、戊所示。在磁场的 A 点处有一氘核发射源,从磁场 I 最低点以速度 v(未知)竖直向下射入磁场 II ,粒子恰好不能飞出磁场 II 区域。在 A 点上方距离为 R 的 O 点处有一氚核发射源,以此为坐标原点建立如图丙所示的坐标系。氚核发射速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" (未知),方向在 xy 平面内,氚核只在磁场 I 中运动。已知氘核与氚核的质量分别为 2m 和 3m,电量都为 q 。现同时发射氘核与氚核,经时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时两粒子相撞并发生聚变反应。粒子运动过程中,不计粒子的重力、空气阻力及粒子间的相互作用力,不考虑相对论效应,求:\n(1)写出氘和氚核聚变的核反应方程式;\n(2)氘原子核射入环形磁场Ⅱ的速度 v 的大小；\n(3)两核子发生碰撞的坐标;\n(4)氚核发射速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/13cf3005f38db38d7a0532f999e977dec674e9367096d3a768cf208a751e22f6.png","width":404,"height":256,"width_mm":47.46,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/674c52afaffc208106fa51e9b155b40ee862655813325da703c5e1f11a461817.png","width":505,"height":254,"width_mm":59.22,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e8507656ab4e62a4569d9ed8e7a3f19911b578f21d22f70f4314c6f5f1e32150.png","width":223,"height":249,"width_mm":26.04,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/404f963bc0304926ca278cfe42a816463441e5250e63649ee1ccae30087d3844.png","width":308,"height":317,"width_mm":36.12,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丁\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f362e5442dde4858d1d585156883a930c986f4aa85c1d8dd19ecee442183620c.png","width":420,"height":264,"width_mm":49.35,"row_group":"jinhua-shixiao-2511-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n戊"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{2}_{1}\\mathrm{H}+{}^{3}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{qBR}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n(3) (2R, 0, -R) （5分） (4)"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{qBR}{3m}\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{4}{\\pi^{2}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(4分)\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{2}_{1}\\mathrm{H}+{}^{3}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n（2）根据牛顿第二定律得"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB=\\frac{2mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{qBR}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）氘核在磁场Ⅱ中的轨迹是半圆，"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{2}=R"},{"type":"text","value":"，在磁场Ⅰ中的轨迹是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"圆，"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=R"},{"type":"text","value":"周期都为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{T}_{\\text{氘}} = \\frac{4\\pi\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{qB}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"text","value":"氘核第二次射入磁场Ⅱ后重复之前的运动过程，在磁场的最高点第三次射入磁场Ⅱ，再重复之前的运动，氘核在磁场中的运动轨迹在横截中的投影如图所示"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/99911228b8b6606b8536521254a0014e0abd8ab91ade19109239350bc1779f17.png","width":337,"height":331,"width_mm":42.6},{"type":"text","value":"所以粒子经过一次磁场Ⅰ和磁场Ⅱ所需时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}+\\frac{\\pi m}{qB}=\\frac{3\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间内共有一次磁场Ⅰ和磁场Ⅱ。\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"x=2R,(1\\text{分})"},{"type":"text","value":"y=0,(1分) z=-R,(1分)\n坐标为(2R,0,-R)\n（4）氚核在磁场中作螺线运动，r = 0.5R，（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{\\text{氚}} = \\frac{6\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以氚核经 0.5 个周期与氘核相遇"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5R = \\frac{3mv_{y}}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{v_y} = \\frac{qBR}{6m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=\\frac{2R}{\\frac{3\\pi m}{qB}}=\\frac{2qBR}{3\\pi m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{v}_0 = \\frac{qBR}{3m}\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{4}{\\pi^2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}}]}
